SAIHV-Reflex-Core-Benchmark
Overview
This repository provides performance benchmarks for the Sovereign Agnostic Intel Hyper-Visor (SAIHV) architecture. SAIHV introduces a deterministic, hardware-reflex paradigm that bypasses traditional inference bottlenecks by interacting directly with silicon-level logic.

